  "goal": "Greet people, say goodbye, thank you and please.",
  "grammar": [
    {
      "title": "ты and вы",
      "explanation": "Russian has two words for 'you'. ты is for a friend, a child or family. вы is for one person you speak to politely (a teacher, a stranger) and for more than one person. Greetings change with it: приве́т goes with ты, здра́вствуйте goes with вы."
    }
  ],
